\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF Sold Y4.703 Tln In March  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 573 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 12:00\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's government sold Y4.703 trillion in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in March to fight yen strength, \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  data showed Wednesday.  \par \par \uc2 That brings \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  total since the start of the year to an unprecedented more than Y15 trillion, and the cumulative total for the past 15 months to more than Y35 trillion.  \par \par \uc2 The amount for March was above the Y3.342 trillion spent in February but far smaller than January's hefty Y7.155 trillion.  \par \par \uc2 Tokyo has been all but absent from the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily to drive the dollar above Y112 earlier this month, leading to speculation that it has abandoned its policy of aggressive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .  \par \par \uc2 A string of local and international media reports have suggested senior officials at the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which conducts \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on behalf of the MOF, are more confident that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's economic recovery can withstand an appreciation of the yen.  \par \par \uc2 Indeed, the MOF was conspicuously absent while the dollar plunged nearly two yen to a four-year low below Y104 in Asia Wednesday on what appeared to be heavy speculative selling.  \par \par \uc2 While a breakdown of day-to-day \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  amounts won't be released until May, most of the March \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to have taken place early in the month, analysts said.  \par \par \uc2 The March data cover transactions settled during the month, or \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out between Feb. 26 and March 29. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders are settled after two business days.  \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    -By Leika Kihara, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; leika.kihara@dowjones.com   \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Alastair Gale  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Corrected March 31, 2004 06:23 ET (11:23 GMT) [ 31-03-04 1006GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Japan's government sold Y4.703 trillion in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market in March to fight yen strength, \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Ministry of Finance\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  data showed Wednesday.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 That brings \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  total since the start of the year to an unprecedented more than Y15 trillion, and the cumulative total for the past 15 months to more than Y35 trillion.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The amount for March was above the Y3.342 trillion spent in February but far smaller than January's hefty Y7.155 trillion.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Tokyo has been all but absent from the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market since it \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  heavily to drive the dollar above Y112 earlier this month, leading to speculation that it has abandoned its policy of aggressive \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A string of local and international media reports have suggested senior officials at the Bank of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which conducts \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on behalf of the MOF, are more confident that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Japan\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's economic recovery can withstand an appreciation of the yen.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Indeed, the MOF was conspicuously absent while the dollar plunged nearly two yen to a four-year low below Y104 in Asia Wednesday on what appeared to be heavy speculative selling.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 While a breakdown of day-to-day \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  amounts won't be released until May, most of the March \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is likely to have taken place early in the month, analysts said.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 The March data cover transactions settled during the month, or \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  carried out between Feb. 26 and March 29. \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  traders are settled after two business days.  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (In an item timed at 1006 GMT, the cumulative \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  totals were misstated.)  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -By Leika Kihara, Dow Jones Newswires; 813-5255-2929; leika.kihara@dowjones.com  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 -Edited by Alastair Gale [ 31-03-04 1122GMT ]  \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020040331e03v000jq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
