\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-BOJ's Fukui endorses Japanese  \highlight22\uc2 forex intervention \highlight\uc2 .  \b0\par\par\uc2 483 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2004\par 03:11\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2004 Reuters Limited  \par \par \uc2  TOKYO, March 23 (Reuters) - Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Toshihiko Fukui endorsed the government's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policies on Tuesday, saying such efforts made sense given a vulnerable economy.   \par \par \uc2  "Japan's economy remains vulnerable to external shocks. Irregular moves in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  are one such shock," he told parliament in a semi-annual hearing on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements that are too irregular may nip the recovery in the bud and affect corporate sentiment... because the current economic recovery was sparked by exports," he said.   \par \par \uc2  Japanese authorities have been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  actively in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, selling a record 20 trillion yen ($187.4 billion) last year and over 10 trillion yen in the first two months this year to shield exporters from a surging yen.   \par \par \uc2  The BOJ is only an agent in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , acting under the orders of the government. But since Fukui took office a year ago, the BOJ and government have been seen working more closely together.   \par \par \uc2  "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  as needed in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2 ... does not conflict with our monetary easing efforts," Fukui said.   \par \par \uc2  The government also arranged a few months ago to sell foreign bonds such as U.S. Treasuries to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  with an agreement to buy them back later, to secure funds for its dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  Fukui said that was an "exceptional and temporary" measure that he hoped would not be repeated, but added the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would consider any call from the government to buy more.   \par \par \uc2  "We hope we won't have to, but if there is such a request, or a slightly different request, we will take it into consideration on a case-by-case basis," he said.   \par \par \uc2  FLEXIBILITY   \par \par \uc2  In addition to building closer ties with the government, Fukui has been credited for taking a more flexible stance in monetary policy than his predecessor, Masaru Hayami.   \par \par \uc2  He has repeatedly eased policy since taking office and introduced various technical changes to the BOJ's money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \uc2  But Fukui said there were rules that ought to be kept, including one that says the BOJ's buying of government bonds should be kept within the amount of bank notes in circulation.   \par \par \uc2  "It is an important rule that should not be changed so easily," he said.   \par \par \uc2  Fukui also shrugged off calls from some government officials that the BOJ should do more to boost the monetary base, saying stimulating economic activity through monetary easing was not a simple matter.   \par \par \uc2  "Because of the breakdown in the relationship between monetary base growth and economic growth, we cannot conduct monetary policy in a mechanical fashion of monetary base growth leading to more economic activity and price developments," he said.   \par \par \uc2  The BOJ has repeatedly eased policy over the past year by raising the target amount of current account deposits kept at the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and keeping interest rates pinned near zero.   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020040323e03n0004y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
